  first time
    Holding your breath, you tiptoe quietly down the stairs. A prickle runs
    up your spine; you are now an intruder. If the Baron catches you here,
    he'll have you tossed back into a jail cell — and that's the best case
    scenario. If what Bobby told you is true, and Fossville knows secrets
    about you that he's trying to hide, it's more likely he'll just slit your
    throat.

    Have to move quickly, then — search the house, find this letter, and get
    out.

