## `play`/`pluck`/`strum`/`twang` (`story.ni:9099-9115`) — a story action;
## its miss is the source's "And how do you propose to do that?". The harp's
## answer rides a trait: a story action never reaches an entity clause.

define action playing
  grammar
    play the target
    pluck the target
    strum the target
    twang the target
    play on the target
  otherwise refuse cant-play-that

define phrase cant-play-that
