define phrase harp-cascade
  Well, maybe if you do it very softly... you swallow the lump in your throat
  and brush the strings lightly with your fingers. A cascade of crystal-clear
  notes wafts through the room. The sound lasts for only a few moments before
  fading away, and you could barely hear it over the thudding of your heart,
  but it was very beautiful.
end phrase

